  "solution": "**Concept Used:**\n\nBODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c49e9ef184ad3a244b4a0e325f1c03fdf73a234e5d04e86e969336de19771c93.png] \n\n**Calculation - **\n\n3 + {large{{ 1 + (1)/(3) - (3 - (4)/(3)) + (1)/(4) + (2)/(3)}} }\n\n⇒ 3 + {large{{ 1 + (1)/(3) - (5)/(3) + (1)/(4) + (2)/(3)}} }\n\n⇒ 3 + {{{(12 + 4 + 3 + 8)/(12) - (5)/(3)}}}\n\n⇒ 3 + {{ (27)/(12) - (5)/(3)}}\n\n⇒ 3 + {{ (7)/(12)}}\n\n⇒ 43/12\n\n**∴ The correct option is 3.**",
